+<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">Good work starts<br>with good teamwork.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to stay in sync. No noise, no surprises—just a better way to work together.</p><div class="billing"><span class="billing-label" id="monthly-label">Monthly</span><button class="switch" id="billing-switch" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="monthly-label yearly-label"><span class="switch-thumb"></span></button><span class="billing-label" id="yearly-label">Yearly</span><span class="save">SAVE 20%</span></div></section>
+<section class="plans" id="plans" aria-label="Pricing plans">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="plan-desc">A calmer way to chat, for small teams getting started.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="$0" data-yearly="$0">$0</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed">Free forever</div><hr><div class="list-label">Included in Free</div><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Up to 10 members</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>90 days of message history</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Unlimited messages &amp; channels</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>1:1 audio and video calls</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Relay%20Free">Get started for free</a></article>
