+<article class="plan"><h2>Business</h2><p class="plan-desc">More control and security for growing organizations.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="$15" data-yearly="$12">$15</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed" data-billed-monthly="Billed monthly" data-billed-yearly="Billed annually · $144 per user">Billed monthly</div><hr><div class="list-label">Everything in Team, plus</div><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Advanced admin controls</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>SAML single sign-on</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Data retention policies</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Priority 24/7 support</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Dedicated onboarding</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Relay%20Business">Talk to our team</a></article>
