+<section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="faq"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</span><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked</h2><p>A few things teams often want to know.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before I pay?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, and you can try Team free for 14 days with no credit card required.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% compared with paying month to month. You are billed once per year, and can change your plan at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel whenever you need to. Changes take effect at the start of your next billing period, and you can always export your data.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my free trial ends?</summary><p>We’ll let you know before your 14-day Team trial ends. If you don’t continue, your workspace moves to Free—your messages and team stay yours.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer plans for larger organizations?</summary><p>Business is built for growing teams. For custom security, procurement, or volume needs, reach out to <a href="mailto:hello@relay.chat">our team</a>.</p></details></div></div></section>
+<section class="bottom-cta" aria-label="Get started"><div><h2>Make room for great work.</h2><p>Bring your team together on Relay. Start free, and grow when you're ready.</p></div><a href="mailto:hello@relay.chat?subject=Get%20started%20with%20Relay">Get started for free&nbsp; →</a></section>
